speechtext:
Mr. Speaker, I want to thank hon. Members for their remarks. The business of the House for Monday will be the second reading of the Bank Act legislation and the Quebec Savings Bank legislation;
(Mr. Churchill.]
the bill to extend the Bank Act, and then Budget resolutions.

June 11. 1965
